OL,2,V55555555CWELSH GROUP CLAIMS
OL,3,Vu5u5u5u5CFIREBOMB ATTACKS
OL,5, Police are probing three new firebomb
OL,6, attacks on English estate agents'
OL,7, offices within hours of each other.
OL,9, A caller to a BBC Wales journalist
OL,10, said attacks in London, Liverpool and
OL,11, the West Midlands were the work of the
OL,12, extremist Sons of Glyndower group.
OL,14, Two of the incendiary devices exploded
OL,15, after being pushed through letter boxes
OL,16, at estate agents in Liverpool and
OL,17, Sutton Coldfield, causing minor damage.
OL,19, In Wapping Bomb Squad officers defused
OL,20, another device. In the past year there
OL,21, have been several Welsh extremist
OL,22, attacks on English estate agents.
OL,23,F]DFrom 19-03-89 / teletextarchive.com
