OL,2,V55555555CCHANNEL CHEMICAL HUNT
OL,3,Vu5u5u5u5CHIT BY WEATHER
OL,5, The French navy has had to call off a
OL,6, search for a container of highly toxic
OL,7, insecticide because of bad weather.
OL,9, The container was from an Indonesian
OL,10, freighter which sank off the Channel
OL,11, Island of Alderney.
OL,13, The drum contains six tons of Lindane,
OL,14, which is linked to cancer and blood
OL,15, disorders and which could kill fish and
OL,16, damage shoreline plants and wildlife.
OL,18, Greenpeace spokesman Paul Johnstone
OL,19, said the Channel could face an
OL,20, environmental disaster if the chemical
OL,21, was released.
OL,23,F]DFrom 19-03-89 / teletextarchive.com
