OL,2,V55555555CYELTSIN SUPPORTERS
OL,3,Vu5u5u5u5CMARCH IN MOSCOW
OL,5, Thousands oe supporters of Kremlin
OL,6, rebel Boris Yeltsin marched through
OL,7, Moscow chanting "Yeltsin, Yeltsin".
OL,9, Some 3,000 people, their numbers
OL,10, swelling as they marched, demanded a
OL,11, halt to official attacks on him.
OL,13, They headed for the Moscow City Council
OL,14, building, a few hundred yards from the
OL,15, Kremlin, after a banned election rally
OL,16, in support of Yeltsin at Gorky Park.
OL,18, As the crowd, largely workers and their
OL,19, wives and families,marched they chanted
OL,20, "Come and join us. Come and join us."
OL,23,F]DFrom 19-03-89 / teletextarchive.com
